01:11:50.270 --> 01:11:55.340
<v Angel Marin>I would compare it to the last time I was in the fetus, bro, like just chilling.

01:11:55.340 --> 01:11:58.970
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.

